    {"line": 6, "text": "The right half, sorted by a recursive call: {right}."},
    {"line": 7, "text": "Now merge the two sorted halves into one list."},
    {"line": 8, "text": "Start at the front of each half."},
    {"line": 9, "next": 10, "text": "Compare the two fronts: {left[i]} and {right[j]}."},
